    "changelog_excerpt": "# 🚀 DMTools Release v1.7.267\n\n## 📝 What's Changed\n\nFull diff: [v1.7.266...v1.7.267](https://github.com/epam/dm.ai/compare/v1.7.266...v1.7.267)\n\n### 🚀 Features\n- Refs resolve against a pack parent (dmtools-dart parity) (8a1b0226)\n- Route writes, title lookup, and attachments to REST v2 under CONFLUENCE_API_VERSION=v2 (#592) (5abd3612)\n- Standalone CLI mode + JS-action skip flags (PR #266 resurrect) (8153cb89)\n- Versioned agent-pack resolution (registry → catalog → sha256 → cache) (e97ff0f2)\n\n### 🐛 Bug Fixes\n- Bind metadata to JS pre/post hook params (#454) (fcf60837)\n- Convert synced blocks (bodied-sync-block) inline instead of dropping them (#596) (1ec63e18)\n- Harden test_case_generator prompt against off-task/refusal responses (3a781186)\n- Honor GitHub X-RateLimit-Reset wait instead of capping at 60s (#1) (fab5b0ea)\n- Registry-ref parent without a configured registry errors clearly (71b076e7)\n- Skip postJSAction when strict-mode CLI produces no output (#409) (4dc714f5)\n\n### 📦 Dependencies\n- Auth (#612) (52f7c1fd)\n- Aws-core (#608) (ff975ea6)\n- Bump gradle-wrapper from 9.7.1 to 9.8.0 (#604) (04dfe60f)\n- Bump versions.graalvm from 25.3.4.1 to 25.4.4.1.1 (e89a393e)\n- Bump versions.jackson3 from 3.2.2 to 3.2.3 (#606) (c06bbd34)\n- Bump versions.mockito from 5.23.0 to 5.24.0 (#609) (2ddb5e26)\n- Commons-compress (#610) (314d2c5a)\n- Jackson-databind (#607) (0eb000c3)\n- Regions (#603) (462ca4b1)\n- Slf4j-api from 2.0.19 to 2.0.20 (#611) (b3757c33)\n\n### 🛠 Maintenance\n- Update coverage badge (#614) (5a856665)\n- Update coverage badge (#620) (fd006871)\n\n### 📋 Other Changes\n- Mirror Dart extraDirs (--include) in AgentPackCompiler (acf6323b)\n\n---\n\nThis release includes the **DMTools CLI** and **Agent Skill** for enterprise dark-factory orchestration across MCP tools, AI agents, and delivery workflows.\n\n## 📦 What's Included\n\n### 🖥️ DMTools CLI\n- **Command-line interface** for DMTools operations\n- **Java-based** automation and integration tools\n- **Cross-platform install scripts*..."
